# vote.tiebreaker=draw + vote.final=final で 3-way 同票 → 即 draw。

++Alice、Bob、Carol
!Alice=人狼
!Bob=村人
!Carol=村人

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Bob→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# 3-way 同票 → draw
# == end ==

# @expect-result: draw
# @expect-finished: true
